  "notes": [
    "This is not a modified copy of the upstream Cliopatria dataset. It is a project-local extension layer.",
    "Polity records must resolve against the pinned Cliopatria release before a scene can use them as authoritative political geometry.",
    "Cities, battles, sieges, people and routes are not falsely assigned Cliopatria polity IDs. They use stable project IDs and external source identifiers.",
    "Routes are rendered as reconstructed paths unless a source provides a route geometry. The renderer must label reconstructed routes accordingly.",
    "The engine should cache and reuse this atlas plus the prepared Cliopatria runtime shards instead of downloading and resolving the same data for every scene."
  ]
